+	 * a VFIO BAR mmap: a BAR mapped with vm_pgoff > 0 creates a
+	 * DMABUF such that byte 0 of the VMA corresponds to byte 0 of
+	 * the DMABUF and byte 'vm_pgoff << PAGE_SHIFT' into the BAR.
